# Keep host artifacts out of the Docker build context — without this,
# `COPY . .` ships Windows node_modules/dist into the Linux image and
# breaks native binaries (esbuild, prisma engines, etc.).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
apps/api/.env
apps/web/.env*
!.env.example
.tmp
neon.ts
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
infra/
docs/
*.md
!README.md
playwright-report
test-results
